<html lang="sq-XK"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</title><meta name="title-id" content="pg067_sec001_p5"><meta name="page-section-id" content="92"><link href="./content/tailwind_output.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="./assets/fonts.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="./book-design/design-system.css?v=31b9b116916778a8" data-book-style="plan" rel="stylesheet"></head><body><main><div id="content" class="bk" data-family="lesson-discussion"><section data-section-id="pg067_sec001_p5" class="bk-stack"><div class="bk-card bk-card--outline bk-stack"><p class="bk-body"><em><span data-id="pg067_n0028">Kosova ka shumë pika kufitare.</span> <span data-id="pg067_n0029">Disa nga vendkalimet kufitare që lidhin Kosovën me shtetet fqinje janë: Qafë-Morina, Qafë-Prushi, Morina, që lidhin Kosovën me Shqipërinë.</span></em></p><p class="bk-body"><em><span data-id="pg067_n0031">Vendkalimi kufitar "Kulla" lidh Kosovën me Malin e Zi.</span></em></p><p class="bk-body"><em><span data-id="pg067_n0033">Në secilën nga këto vendkalime kufitare është flamuri i të dyja shteteve që i lidh ai kufi.</span></em></p></div><p class="bk-body"><strong data-id="pg067_n0035">Fjalët kyçe:</strong> <span data-id="pg067_n0036">shtet fqinj, vendkalim kufitar, kontroll, organe policore, pasaportë, dokument.</span></p></section></div></main><script>window.activityAnswerTextIds = JSON.parse('{}');</script><div id="interface-container"></div><div id="nav-container"></div><script src="./assets/offline-preloader.js"></script><script src="./assets/scorm.js"></script><script src="./assets/base.bundle.local.js"></script></body></html>